OL,3,AUS House blocks bid to impeach Defence
OL,4,ASecretary Pete Hegseth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bid to find the cabinet secretary
OL,7,Fguilty of misconduct and ultimately
OL,8,Fremove him from office was seen as a
OL,9,Flong shot as it could have required a
OL,10,Fnumber of other Republicans to defy
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump.
